  m_text: The Catcher can catch any switcher outside of their safe zone. All the
    Catcher has to do is to get too close to the Switcher and Zap!!. The lightning
    does it's thing and the Switcher is gone. But keep in mind that all of this will
    only happen if the Catcher has not drained it's powers.
