  m_text: To own a pole, a Switcher has to get to it before any other Switcher gets
    there. After they own a pole, Switchers are safe inside them and even if a Catcher
    gets nearby, nothing will happen. But Catchers have other plans to cause trouble
    to a Switcher even in their owned poles!
