  m_text: This is a Catcher. His only job is to catch the Switchers. But he can do
    it only when he has powers. He gets his powers from the power source present
    at the centre of the arena. After he leaves that power source his powers start
    to drain. Catcher can recharge it's powers anytime by going to the power source.
